Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 12:36:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Car framework sizes for the 800x480 dash

Local, uncommitted edits from the 2026-08-30 settings work, captured now
as device/brcm/rpi5/patches/frameworks_base/0001: dimens_car.xml (car text
sizes, list row heights, margins, avatar sizes reduced for the 592x352 px
panel at 120 dpi) and the car alert-dialog button bar (80 dp min width,
40 dp height).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Icf03c64d5a06684057787559045681557336b995
